  <h2 id="entry-path">Entry path, degree, and hiring bar</h2>

  <p>
    "What should I study" is one of the first real questions in this decision, and the honest answer is that
    the two hiring bars genuinely test different things.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
