        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="salary-reality">Salary reality: fresher to senior, without the marketing numbers</h2>

  <p>
    Salary pages for this exact comparison tend to quote whichever field's best-case numbers fit their
    narrative. Here is the range you can realistically expect at each stage, based on current 2026
    salary-tracking sources and hiring reports for the Indian market.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Career stage</th>
