          <p>{item.body}</p>
          <div class="checkpoint__note">{item.note}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p>
    If you are still unsure after running this test honestly, a session inside
    <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career guidance</a>
    can help you compare both paths against your specific background, instead of guessing alone from salary
    screenshots and forum threads.
  </p>

  <h2 id="who-fits-mle">Who genuinely fits machine learning engineering</h2>

  <div class="feature-grid">
